@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Ruta inexistente -> 404 JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/nope

### ---------- AUTH (Paso 7) ----------

### Sin token -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks

### Registrar usuario -> 201 (sin hash)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@test.com", "password": "supersecreta" }

### Registrar de nuevo -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@test.com", "password": "supersecreta" }

### Login con contrasena incorrecta -> 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@test.com", "password": "incorrecta123" }

### Login correcto -> 200 { accessToken }  (copia el accessToken en @token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@test.com", "password": "supersecreta" }

### Pega aqui tu token
@token = PEGA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Usuario del token -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Token alterado -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}x

### ---------- TASKS (todas con token) ----------

### Listar tareas -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear tarea valida -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "  Tarea creada desde requests.http  ", "description": "Prueba del paso 5" }

### Crear con title vacio -> 400 con details
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "" }

### Obtener por id -> 200 (cambia el 1 por un id real)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener id inexistente -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener con id invalido -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### PATCH done -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "done": true }

### PATCH vacio -> 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### DELETE -> 204 (cambia el id por uno que puedas borrar)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### DELETE otra vez -> 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
